**Example Mapper:**

```java
@Component
public class OffreMapper {
    
    public OffreResponse toResponse(Offre offre) {
        OffreResponse res = new OffreResponse();
        
        res.setId(offre.getId());
        res.setTitre(offre.getTitre());
        res.setDescription(offre.getDescription());
        res.setLieu(offre.getLieu());
        res.setTypeOffre(offre.getType());
        res.setStatutOffre(offre.getStatut());
        
        // Transform: Image bytes → Base64 string
        if (offre.getImage() != null) {
            res.setImageBase64(Base64.getEncoder().encodeToString(offre.getImage()));
            res.setImageType(offre.getImageType());
            res.setImageNom(offre.getImageNom());
        }
        
        // Extract nested object: Pole name
        if (offre.getPole() != null) {
            res.setPoleId(offre.getPole().getId());
            res.setPoleNom(offre.getPole().getNom());
        }
        
        // Creator name
        if (offre.getCreatedBy() != null) {
            String nom = ((offre.getCreatedBy().getPrenom() != null ? offre.getCreatedBy().getPrenom() : "") + \" \" + (offre.getCreatedBy().getNom() != null ? offre.getCreatedBy().getNom() : \"\")).trim();
            res.setCreatedByNom(nom.isEmpty() ? offre.getCreatedBy().getEmail() : nom);
        }
        
        return res;
    }
}
```

### Security Layer (tn/star/Pfe/security/)

| Class | Purpose | Key Methods |
|-------|---------|------------|
| `JwtUtils.java` | Generate and validate JWT tokens | generateAccessToken, isValidToken, getEmailFromToken |
| `JwtAuthFilter.java` | Filter incoming requests for JWT | doFilterInternal (validates every request) |
| `UserPrincipal.java` | Authenticated user representation | getAuthorities (return user roles) |
