## Key Metrics & Monitoring

### Performance Metrics to Monitor

- **Response Time**: Average API response time (target: <200ms)
- **Database Query Time**: Slow query log (target: <100ms)
- **Throughput**: Requests per second (target: >1000 RPS)
- **Error Rate**: 5xx errors (target: <0.1%)
- **Cache Hit Rate**: Redis cache hit percentage (target: >80%)

### Logging Strategy

```java
// Use SLF4J with Logback
@Slf4j
@Service
public class OffreService {
    
    public void creer(OffreRequest req) {
        log.debug(\"Creating offre with title: {}\", req.titre());
        
        try {
            Offre offre = offreRepository.save(...);
            log.info(\"Offre created successfully: id={}, title={}\", offre.getId(), offre.getTitre());
            publisher.publishEvent(new OffreCreatedEvent(offre));
        } catch (Exception e) {
            log.error(\"Failed to create offre: {}\", req.titre(), e);
            throw new InternalServerException(\"Failed to create offer\");
        }
    }
}
```

